.TH mouser-model-hf 1  "mouser-model-hf 1.6.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mouser\-model\-hf \- GGUF models from Hugging Face for the local engine: search, info, install, list, remove
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmouser model hf\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
GGUF models from Hugging Face for the local engine: search, info, install, list, remove
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mouser\-model\-hf\-search(1)
Search Hugging Face for GGUF models (most downloaded first), with each one\*(Aqs download size (smallest–largest quantization, split files summed)
.TP
mouser\-model\-hf\-pick(1)
Choose interactively on the terminal: type a query, pick a repository, then a quantization (with its size); it installs like `install` (asks first). Esc goes back, Ctrl\-C leaves; needs a terminal
.TP
mouser\-model\-hf\-info(1)
A model\*(Aqs card summary, numbers, license and quantizations
.TP
mouser\-model\-hf\-install(1)
Download one quantization (default: the smallest Q4) and make it the default model. Shows the size and asks first
.TP
mouser\-model\-hf\-list(1)
The installed Hugging Face models
.TP
mouser\-model\-hf\-remove(1)
Delete an installed model\*(Aqs files
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmouser\fR(1)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
